# Routine "Ready for dev sweep": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Friday afternoon, lists the frames marked ready for dev that still have no spec, and offers to write the next one.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/figma-bro && pi -p "/ready-for-dev-sweep"
